{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>Let us journey.</b> Like שִׁמְעָה, סִלְחָה — which are like שְׁמַע, סְלַח; so too here, נִסְעָה is like נְסַע, and the nun is a root letter in the word. And the Targum of Onkelos: טוּל וּנְהָךְ — Esau said to Jacob: let us journey from here and go." "<b>And I will go at your pace.</b> Equal to you — this good thing I will do for you: I will lengthen the days of my journey, to go slowly as you need. And this is לְנֶגְדֶּךָ — equal to you."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:01:55.350177426Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}